  "details": "So I've recently been uploading alot of public avatars or test avatars for myself, and I've thought constantly about how I want to be able to move them around so my main privates are at the front and that I don't have to hunt them down in my list, as I've got a terrible pc that takes hours just to upload a simple Medium avatar, I think having a organizer area where we can grab the avatar in our creations and move to to whatever position we want, it would also help sort avatars we want together without having t completely reupload every avatar to have them in the front. This could be a feature done on the VRC website. Thank you for hearing me, out this means alot to me cause my avatars are a mESS rn due to me testing avatars and having public's",
